<title>HONG KONG: China Merchants Hai Hong changes name.</title>
<headline>China Merchants Hai Hong changes name.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>China Merchants Hai Hong Holdings Co Ltd said on Wednesday it had changed the company name to China Merchants Holdings (International) Co Ltd with effect from June 16.</p>
<p>The company said its shareholders had on May 29 approved a special resolution for the change of the company name.</p>
<p>China Merchants shares gained HK$2.05 or 12.42 percent to HK$18.55 at midday on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370.  http://www.hk97.com</p>
